Ora ecco dove

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.550
molti sviluppatori in chat.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:44.210
Il token di Convalida

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:44.910
deve essere restituito

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:45.790
come testo semplice

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.350
non JSON

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:46.910
non HTML

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.750
testo semplice

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.810
e la risposta deve avere

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:49.850
