00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:08.790
Quindi se il tuo endpoint

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.910
accetta solo connessioni

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:10.970
TLS 1.3

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:12.070
la handshake di Convalida

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:12.890
